      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneII_13.2/p@65716",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "YORK.\nAnd, Neville, this I do assure myself:\nRichard shall live to make the Earl of Warwick\nThe greatest man in England but the king.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
